   "use": "Talk of the bath or shower routine: kami aratte kara neru, or kami arau no mendokusai (washing my hair is a pain). At home people say atama arau just as often (atama aratta?, especially to kids). O drops in casual speech.",
   "notes": "Drying it afterwards is kami o kawakasu (kami kawakashite). Shanpuu suru is also everyday (shanpuu shite kara neru).",
