   "use": "Said as a reminder or a chore: tsume kitte (cut your nails), tsume kiranakya. O often drops; the clippers are tsumekiri.",
   "notes": "Many people still know the superstition against cutting your nails at night (yoru tsume o kiru to...).",
   "example": {
